    <a href="/blog/college-degrees/">college and degrees</a> category covers related ROI questions
    across diplomas, degree loans, and course choices. If you want a second opinion on whether an
    EMBA fits your specific career stage before you spend a rupee on an application,
    <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/">career guidance</a>
    can help you compare it against your other real options with an actual person.
  </p>

