          <p>{item.body}</p>
          <div class="checkpoint__note">{item.note}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <h2 id="gates">Pass The 3 Gates before you apply</h2>

  <p>
    The 4-Checkpoint Protocol tells you whether an EMBA fits on paper. The 3 Gates make you test it
    against reality before you spend a rupee on an application fee.
  </p>

  <div class="gates-block">
    <p class="gates-block__title">
      Do not submit an application or pay a fee before passing all three gates.
    </p>
    <div class="gates-row">
      {gateItems.map((item) => (
        <div class="gate">
